WEBVTT

00:12:59.531 --> 00:13:01.401
We fix it; but most importantly,

00:13:01.425 --> 00:13:02.582
we relocate it.

00:13:02.606 --> 00:13:04.430
And what I mean by that is,

00:13:04.454 --> 00:13:06.162
we find a new job for it.

00:13:06.186 --> 00:13:10.196
Nuclear energy, fission,
is a really bad idea for bombs.

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:15.615
But it may be a pretty good idea
relocated into sustainable nuclear energy

00:13:15.639 --> 00:13:17.957
for electricity, instead of burning coal.

00:13:17.981 --> 00:13:19.696
When we have a bad idea,

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:21.284
the response to a bad idea

00:13:21.308 --> 00:13:24.628
is not no ideas,
it's not to stop thinking.

00:13:24.652 --> 00:13:26.805
The response to a bad idea --

00:13:26.829 --> 00:13:28.957
like, say, a tungsten lightbulb --

00:13:28.981 --> 00:13:31.220
is a better idea.